{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "af2f0e1d35f273b5a6342d9ecabd9009c2464a5bdc2622712c06bbc72ee366d7", "ja": "リサーチ・ナウ", "zh": "调查进行时", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fb78300d79d1dc7afcf892116c8071548e6dfa3875aa11573ceb97395c7a0104", "ja": "劇場が90年代にタイムスリップしてしまっ\nたが、メンバー達はむしろ状況を楽しむ。\n歩とのり子が雑誌やCDに夢中になる中、海\n美とエレナは商店街へと赴き、現代と変わ\nりない日常を学ぶのだった。", "zh": "剧场意外穿越到了90年代，不过成员们反而享受起了这种状况。\n步和纪子沉迷于杂志和CD之中，而海美与艾莲娜则前往商店街，体验与现代并无二致的日常生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "773377aaee0909c79fbe9f20b22cc698713650692c5a3422d004b837af19e244", "ja": "（劇場が1990年代にタイムスリップしてしまった！\nまずは、みんなに説明をしないと……）", "zh": "（剧场穿越到了1990年代！首先得向大家说明情况才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f32af2cc49f129b1d82c7e2ae8232a9fee7d404b0c529ccfc4724af6a71bd29f", "ja": "（いや、むしろ、こちらも状況を説明して\n欲しいくらいではあるんだけども……うーん）", "zh": "（不，倒不如说，我也想让他们把情况说明给我听……嗯——）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e27e8ec33ccfa5e7186f5a25a209a887117dab89578bcfd2af9279ccde1b1ba4", "ja": "タイムスリップ！？", "zh": "穿越时空！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "e27e8ec33ccfa5e7186f5a25a209a887117dab89578bcfd2af9279ccde1b1ba4", "ja": "タイムスリップ！？", "zh": "穿越时空！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "e27e8ec33ccfa5e7186f5a25a209a887117dab89578bcfd2af9279ccde1b1ba4", "ja": "タイムスリップ！？", "zh": "穿越时空！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "e27e8ec33ccfa5e7186f5a25a209a887117dab89578bcfd2af9279ccde1b1ba4", "ja": "タイムスリップ！？", "zh": "穿越时空！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "20e001d01dac1ee040aaf0f49fd900e75847ff5bb50b5714c1e12686dc0ebd00", "ja": "って、急に言われてもピンと来ないな～。\n劇場の電気も水道も、使えるままだし……。", "zh": "突然这么说，我也没法马上理解啊～。  \n剧场的电和水也都还能正常使用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "d050b74c1eb057f633fbc93cebe5bf3606e322f1b7ec204a67862b0a5623758b", "ja": "劇場の外は、90年代なノ？\nでも窓の外の景色……いつもと同じだよネ？", "zh": "剧场外面是90年代吗？\n可是窗外的景色……和往常一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "888ccbab1bafb8836fef1f140b5a2776d4a3a98e2a92a334ab9955f69a29f511", "ja": "変わってるような、変わってないような……？\n風景の細かいところは、覚えてないもんね～。", "zh": "好像变了，又好像没变……？\n毕竟风景的细节，根本就记不清嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "abecd4c21bcc8702c6e0928fc886747f2bb67603b9cc049acd35516152e24234", "ja": "それにその……劇場の魂って、何？\n新ユニットのためとか言ってたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "而且那个……剧场的灵魂，究竟是什么？\n好像还说是为了新组合什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a5c7751725626cec3bdcfe41dadc3b081cf526a13214eb452433dbc9f6837826", "ja": "それに関しては、俺もよくわからないんだけど。\n劇場の守り神みたいなものって言えばいいのか……。", "zh": "关于那个，我也不太明白。该说是剧场的守护神之类的东西吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "de8fe6e95bec5f3f1b4193b295aedabb04803a3ab392ef082dd3658667ded91c", "ja": "それがさっきまで、私の体に入ってたのか～。\nもしかして……幽霊だったりして！？", "zh": "原来刚才它一直在我的身体里吗～。\n难道说……是幽灵！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "482d15350a4b1956603dc5888583509bda96d686ab3c84ef9d65b82a11c6bace", "ja": "マイガー……っ！　海美、そういうのはいいから！\n想像しただけで寒気がするよ！", "zh": "天啊……！海美，这种事就别说了！\n光是想象一下就让我毛骨悚然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "90f7e63eecb7c7a2e826161c886c1812cc731809a7d9c30c899ee1c21bc10ffe", "ja": "わ、ワタシもダメなんだヨ～！\nオバケなんて、いない……いないよネ？", "zh": "我、我也受不了这种啦～！\n幽灵什么的，根本不存在……不存在的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "0c5a6cf541d9250852859b72586b250504c39c943838870f265fb3a3435ec243", "ja": "お、オバケなんて、いるわけないよエレナ！\nうん、信じない信じない……！", "zh": "啊，埃莉娜！怎么可能会有鬼嘛！\n嗯，我不信，我不信……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "145357e7035fd05b17e6ee73cc4857124694088759eba99d8e53c0851f13df78", "ja": "まあ……信じられない事だとは思う。\nだから、急いで色々買ってきたんだ。", "zh": "也是……确实挺难让人置信的。\n所以，我就赶忙去买了些东西回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "53d4cad0db3a7034f7d80660a496021665ad546f4fbeb01d113caadce42ba35a", "ja": "これって……音楽雑誌？　あっ！　表紙が\nマイクル・ジョンソン！　うわぁ、若い……！", "zh": "这本是……音乐杂志？啊！封面上是迈克尔·约翰逊！哇，好年轻……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "05fab0af68385720b3cc42c2b0b9609457fd620fb4bfbd47b20b2b4720140461", "ja": "この時期のマイクル、本当にかっこいいんだよ！\nダンスもキレッキレでさぁ！", "zh": "那个时期的迈克尔真的超帅！舞也跳得特别利落！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "cdbf46e3860a6deff5e0cee417a0b612a22ae478d9bff0a1d02b7aaa5049088a", "ja": "プロレス雑誌もある！　わぁ……分厚い！　感動！\n往年の名選手の記事、満載じゃん！", "zh": "连摔跤杂志都有！哇……好厚！太感动了！\n里面全是往年名将的报道，内容真丰富啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "952b1f1c6c97150a054591e6034f695825563cfcf0d9048da17f13551d2aff1a", "ja": "ファッション誌もたくさんあるヨ！\n今見ても、とってもかわいいネ♪", "zh": "时尚杂志也有好多哦！\n现在看也还是特别可爱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "344a2482e52b2339da51c4d1d2b3dd11c8af1999e1f5106b819ac875fe5ee871", "ja": "おお～！　これは確かにかわいい……\n90年代の女子力、勉強になるかも！", "zh": "哦哦～！这个确实很可爱……\n90年代女生的魅力，说不定也值得好好学习呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "805ac7644372358575567b25e58236dd40889735fab81f338ca4c17c469d69ac", "ja": "こういうのが見られるなら、90年代に\nタイムスリップも悪くないかもね！　なんて♪", "zh": "要是能看到这样的东西，穿越回90年代似乎也不错呢！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "4fe93ef037ddb36c8f1614b097593569ff87157492cbbde312b5e521002a5563", "ja": "でも{$P$}。ワタシたち、\n特訓の合宿中でしょ？　これからどうするの？", "zh": "可是{$P$}，我们现在不是正在集训吗？接下来要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f777eca59cedcfe48990ddca25569763e5a94faf59a53b2060c0702841f6d0ef", "ja": "そうだな……こうなった以上、やることはひとつ。\nレッスンをしよう！", "zh": "是啊……既然都这样了，要做的就只有一件事。\n开始训练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "b969d677a273fa03afea9a03378b6b73490b07ec9e28bd589b4c68d33ed6a0af", "ja": "えーっ！？　せっかく90年代に\n来たのに遊ばないの！？", "zh": "诶——！？好不容易来到90年代，居然不玩玩吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "619666fe8ebcf09a50f910b39c07615713d64c04da0ab8bd39674676ac2cdb1a", "ja": "せっかくって、遊びに来たわけじゃないから……。\nそれにあくまで、劇場での合宿中なわけだし。", "zh": "什么叫难得啊，我们又不是来玩的……而且说到底，现在还在剧场合宿中呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "120b3655165e51c59c33ff56eeb450b6631bbdf5db039dfe4eb5e30d65b3bf64", "ja": "それに、劇場の魂の言った事だけど……このユニットが\n上手くいく事が、事態の解決に繋がるみたいなんだ。", "zh": "而且，虽然这是剧场之魂说的……这个组合顺利进行下去，好像就能解决眼下的状况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "97b380a99128cc9d3390801d0004817bbc162ed0e681fda0d1effada9afbdc60", "ja": "それなら、なおさら外に出て、\n90年代の空気を感じたほうがいいんじゃない？", "zh": "既然这样，就更应该出去感受一下90年代的空气，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "7e3bc025f1c0b0f6ee5d93740b5725ae1702097588fc8609ab22c7a04a45cee8", "ja": "そのほうがユニットの役に立ちそうだし、\nワタシも賛成だヨ！", "zh": "那样似乎更能帮助到组合，我也赞成哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f4ad0eb3e2a3b1947e39d0727c7e1f00743c3c0e5fdf885d784090b3d3ae5e09", "ja": "うわっ、限定のCDもある！　これ、ちゃんと\n聴いておきたかったんだよな～！", "zh": "哇，还有限定版CD！这个我早就想好好听听了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "363b77528d4967fbdf52686615e1eeebb45720d238db2e3f60b7adc719b55d57", "ja": "グラビアもこんなに……宝の山だよ～！\nいくら時間があっても足りないくらい！", "zh": "写真页也有这么多……简直是宝藏啊～！\n就算有再多时间也不够用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "2493aee08a7970931e492f6d5b16c73b736c9985b024bef8f969d5fd702a2968", "ja": "アユムもノリコも90年代を楽しんでるし、\nワタシたちも楽しみたいヨ～。ねえねえ、いいでしょ？", "zh": "步和法子都在享受90年代，我们也想享受一下嘛～。好不好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "ee6cc92275df94ea99a565f27da241a066120889817d30b62ae8b7c58b48bcb3", "ja": "やっぱり外の空気を吸ってこそだもん！\nお願い、{$P$}！", "zh": "果然还是要到外面呼吸新鲜空气才行嘛！拜托了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1033_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "c505593da0cc924b6d70b64b719e4ff77f87d98e273bf693cf8cda0a901db33a", "ja": "ここが、90年代の街なんだ～！　フムフム……\nいろんな人がいて、いろんなものが売ってるネ！", "zh": "这里就是90年代的街道啊～！嗯嗯……\n有各种各样的人，也卖着各种各样的东西呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "90ba1e0ff706bdcc347915b04ae019b53e643ec1d012de9b7c3943469601c1ad", "ja": "すう、はあ……。これが90年代の匂いかぁ～。\nソースの焦げたいい匂いっていうか……。", "zh": "吸气，呼气……这就是90年代的味道吗～。该说是酱汁烧焦后的香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "3aae4e730ac35d0f115cf510323b89e5b072528a4e29e60eb1fc4b49daf61f87", "ja": "ウミ、たこ焼きが売ってるヨ！\nはんぶんこしようヨ♪", "zh": "海美，有卖章鱼烧哦！\n我们一人一半吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "2e95b5da1e33fee20ee43d3d4ff229292d9de9e6e8642fb96b334399875bcf54", "ja": "うん！　90年代のたこ焼き、楽しみ～♪\nあっ、でも90年代焼きそばも気になるな……。", "zh": "嗯！90年代的章鱼烧，好期待啊～  \n啊，不过90年代的炒面也让人在意呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "e29f64c4dbdf996ddaa5f7de258ddbfb84c96825dff1a37a3b4f2793c6bef331", "ja": "（結局、商店街に来てしまった。でも確かに、\n90年代の空気を感じる機会は貴重ではあるからな）", "zh": "（结果，还是来到了商店街。不过确实，能感受90年代的氛围，这样的机会很难得。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "c26740251a0c5179676716066cb6d7fa364a9bf5e4efa6f519ad06c30febe11a", "ja": "でも……90年代って、\n今とそんなに変わらないんだネ？", "zh": "不过……90年代，和现在也没那么不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "8378828867e564c5a942770b3af3acd8f5f9d0b0778f7216cdbfe04fd077383a", "ja": "うん。コンビニもあるし……今でも、\nこういう雰囲気の街は、あるかなぁって感じ。", "zh": "嗯。不仅有便利店……感觉就算放到现在，\n好像也还是有这种氛围的街道呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "6d1ae0686f5422de470fbb32ecd4121dad85bedb8df10f95831b6a393a6fb17a", "ja": "ワタシたち、90年代の雰囲気を\nちゃんと掴めてないのかナ……？", "zh": "我们是不是没能好好抓住90年代的氛围呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "a4c955898fced82256eb57a03688e730dd4967a8a61e40fae48940b9868b8205", "ja": "う～ん。ここは90年代のはずなのに……\nなんか見落としてる、とか？", "zh": "嗯～这里应该是90年代才对，可是……是不是漏看了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2db818d8416a1cf8244ba74237eef8b899e696b368d0b735bbf65d9696f90a30", "ja": "でもふたりの感想は『現代と変わらない』なんだろ？\nなら、それが正解なんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，你们两人的感想都是“和现代没什么不同”，对吧？\n那这不就是正确答案吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "7583495bf98bc17d4a2612183c7488c77ff9b25091c3a60196818a34c4c8fa89", "ja": "あっ！　そっか……そうだよネ。", "zh": "啊！这样啊……是这么回事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "20551cc49020ae4b8f55a7b751c4e7224decb4066bfaeafcee7cfdbe56bd5ab0", "ja": "そっかぁ。ここに来て初めて、私たちの今と\nあんまり変わらないってことが、わかったんだ！", "zh": "原来如此。来到这里后我才明白，原来和我们现在的情况没什么区别！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "39d3d92bb3fd9c970fa1846f68339cd468d0f5b4da22d22e9d53724b1435c8fe", "ja": "90年代のこと、ちょっとだけわかったカモ。\nね、ウミ！", "zh": "关于90年代的事，我可能稍微了解了一点呢。\n对吧，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "eba92834aea963778a5505bc3f05194d895ca20f16d34e37e8315099c4f7633f", "ja": "うん！　90年代のたこ焼きも、\n今と変わらずおいしそうだしね！", "zh": "嗯！90年代的章鱼烧，看起来也和现在一样好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "fcbf74dfa353701b6ee906fe59019cf1cb633c4a358651f5077152a4a8c10e0f", "ja": "（ふたりなりに90年代を捉えてくれたみたいだ。\nちょっとずつ、前進してるな！）", "zh": "（她们两个似乎都按照自己的方式理解了90年代。正在一点一点地向前进步呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
